{
  "summary": "This experiment tested weighted fusion in a high-performing multimodal setup (scvi_n200 RNA encoder, imagenet_vit_l image encoder) compared to concat fusion (config_008). Validation accuracy (0.7062) and F1 (0.6671) are lower than config_008's 0.7150 accuracy and 0.6872 F1, suggesting weighted fusion may not improve performance in this configuration. Uncertainty remains about the optimal fusion strategy and whether other design choices could further enhance multimodal integration."
}

